{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121380","id":4054915809,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7xsRrh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121380","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121380.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121380.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121380","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121380/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121380/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121380/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ea0b220bf7f84b81e88e35855058d70e22f28b8f","number":121380,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `ZIPReader.decompress`","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Partially closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12777\r\n\r\nImplements `ZIPReader.decompress` (but not `ZIPPacker.compress`).\r\nEdit: Implemented `ZIPPacker.compress` in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121430.\r\n\r\nYou can use it like this:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar err: Error = ZIPReader.decompress(\"res://example-dir.zip\", \"res://example-output\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe key advantages of this approach:\r\n- Much simpler than manually decompressing each file\r\n- Does not load each file into memory - reads them in 64KiB chunks instead\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI have tested the pull request works for extracting ZIP files, including nested and empty directories.\r\n\r\nThere are a few things I would like to discuss:\r\n1. Is 64KiB the best size for the buffer?\r\n2. I have added a check to ensure the extracted directory doesn't escape the output directory (in the case of malicious ZIPs which use absolute paths or `..`). Is my check enough?\r\n3. Would the method be better placed in a dedicated `ZIPAccess` class?\r\n\r\nDemo: [zip-high-level-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30019748/zip-high-level-demo.zip)\r\n\r\n## Related discussion\r\n\r\nI have also noticed that Godot is using `unzOpen2` and `zlib_filefunc_def` when it could be using `unzOpen2_64` and `zlib_filefunc64_def`. As a result, Godot errors if the ZIP file is more than 2GiB. Is there something stopping us from upgrading to the 64-bit versions?\r\n\r\n## AI disclosure\r\n\r\nI did not use AI to write the pull request, but I used AI to check my work and identify mistakes.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":